Bind Npc 21510 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 11510 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 220 "Guardian of 7 Keys"
    Journal for karus "I promised the Captain to bring the 7th key."
    Journal for elmorad "I promised the Captain to bring the 7th key."
    Give 1 of 910050000 on accept
    Collect 1 of 910057000

Requires player level >= 60

Rewards
    Give 38047370 experience

direction_432 = location "[Gatekeeper of the Key]" about "[Gatekeeper of the Key]\nGuardian of the seventh key" found "El Morad mainland" at 100 100 in zone 1
direction_439 = location "[Gatekeeper of the Key]" about "[Gatekeeper of the Key]\nGuardian of the seventh key" found "Karus mainland" at 100 100 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master! Let's go see the Guardian of the Seven Keys~"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Show quest "Seven keys to the Land of the Hidden Truth were made according to ancient records discovered near the Land of the Fairies but they were entrusted to different guardians who all went their separate ways. Will you go retrieve the seven keys?"

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        If player lacks 910050000 and player lacks 910057000
            Say "Please retrieve the seventh key for me. I will give you another written order."
            Topic "Confirm" do
                Transaction
                    Give 1 of 910050000
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_432
        Else
            Say "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh key? You must retrieve the seventh key in order to complete your mission."
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_432
    If player is elmorad
        If player lacks 910050000 and player lacks 910057000
            Say "Please retrieve the seventh key for me. I will give you another written order."
            Topic "Confirm" do
                Transaction
                    Give 1 of 910050000
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_439
        Else
            Say "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh key? You must retrieve the seventh key in order to complete your mission."
            Topic "Where can I find it?" do
                Map direction_439

On claimable
    Show quest "Did you retrieve the seventh key? If you give me the seventh key I will award you EXP in return."
